{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Coffee Express: Barista Simulator",
    "steam_appid": 3044520,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044520/extras/89f7308d678537ee9e4c6cea5f122f9d.avif?t=1754320776\" width=616 height=131 /></span>Sit back and run your own coffee shop in the caffeine-filled world of Coffee Express! Coffee Express is a single-player first-person simulation game where you take over your coffee shop as a barista and work your way up to becoming the town's favorite coffee shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044520/extras/bac691bb77fe8bfa1e8ea4fcf4b12613.avif?t=1754320776\" width=616 height=304 /></span>Coffee Express is no ordinary coffee making game. All types of coffee have realistic brewing stages. So you may need to use several different items to make a coffee. Espresso and filter coffee makers, portafilters and more will become yours as you develop your shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044520/extras/59abaaa27f8022260649f03cdd2a095e.avif?t=1754320776\" width=616 height=304 /></span>Sometimes you may want to go out of the routine or the customer may ask you to do something different. For example, a cute customer might ask you to draw a flower on their latte or write something silly on their coffee cup. Maybe you need to go outside the recipe? We leave some things up to your talent for a freer experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044520/extras/81a24dbcb788f55aa916499f751108c6.avif?t=1754320776\" width=616 height=304 /></span>Walk around the street and visit other shops. Listen to the interesting stories of the customers and treat them the way you like.  Be a good barista, a good neighbor and a good friend &lt;3 (Or not to be...) Remember there is no stress in this game, only coffee and peace!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044520/extras/89f7308d678537ee9e4c6cea5f122f9d.avif?t=1754320776\" width=616 height=131 /></span>Sit back and run your own coffee shop in the caffeine-filled world of Coffee Express! Coffee Express is a single-player first-person simulation game where you take over your coffee shop as a barista and work your way up to becoming the town's favorite coffee shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044520/extras/bac691bb77fe8bfa1e8ea4fcf4b12613.avif?t=1754320776\" width=616 height=304 /></span>Coffee Express is no ordinary coffee making game. All types of coffee have realistic brewing stages. So you may need to use several different items to make a coffee. Espresso and filter coffee makers, portafilters and more will become yours as you develop your shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044520/extras/59abaaa27f8022260649f03cdd2a095e.avif?t=1754320776\" width=616 height=304 /></span>Sometimes you may want to go out of the routine or the customer may ask you to do something different. For example, a cute customer might ask you to draw a flower on their latte or write something silly on their coffee cup. Maybe you need to go outside the recipe? We leave some things up to your talent for a freer experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044520/extras/81a24dbcb788f55aa916499f751108c6.avif?t=1754320776\" width=616 height=304 /></span>Walk around the street and visit other shops. Listen to the interesting stories of the customers and treat them the way you like.  Be a good barista, a good neighbor and a good friend &lt;3 (Or not to be...) Remember there is no stress in this game, only coffee and peace!</p>",
    "short_description": "Open your own coffee shop and become a barista in the cozy and colorful world of Coffee Express! A unique experience awaits you with stock tracking, realistic coffee making experience and shop customizations. Make your customers happy by making excellent coffee in your own coffee paradise!",
